# research-reopens section lists every open trigger, event: ones included.
# Only a ticker's newest line counts -- a re-research retires the old trigger.
# Absent reopen= means the thesis states no reopen condition. Backfilled
# 2026-07-29 from each thesis's falsifier/verdict prose.
